he rescue capsules' descriptions they stand for the number of such capsules in each laboratory.\n\n## Output\n\nPrint a single number ΓÇö the maximum number of scientists who will manage to save themselves.\n\n## Examples\n\nExample 1:\n```\n3 3\n1YZ\n1YY\n100\n\n0YZ\n0YY\n003\n```\n```\n2\n```\n\n## Note\n\nIn the second sample the events could take place as follows:","type":"text"}],"contestId":78,"index":"E","memoryLimit":"256 megabytes","name":"Evacuation","problemKey":"78-E","rating":null,"tags":[],"timeLimit":"1 second","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/78/problem/E"}],"schemaVersion":1}
